                "heading": "Fast & Secure Shipping",
                "icon": "shipping",
                "text": "<p>We offer international shipping through trusted logistics partners, including <strong>FedEx, UPS, and freight carriers</strong>, to ensure reliable delivery worldwide. Orders are shipped from China or, where inventory is available, from our regional warehouses in <strong>Germany, Poland, and the U.S. West Coast</strong>.</p><p>In-stock eBikes are typically dispatched within <strong>3 business days</strong>, with international delivery generally taking <strong>approximately 30 days</strong>, depending on the destination and shipping method.</p><p>As our U.S. and EU warehouse network expands, we expect to <strong>significantly reduce delivery times</strong>, with faster regional fulfillment becoming available.</p><p><strong>Please Note:</strong> All shipping and delivery times are estimates and cannot be guaranteed. Actual delivery times may vary due to customs clearance, carrier operations, and other logistical factors. Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive tracking information to monitor your shipment's progress.</p>",
